  ('7471245e-287d-519a-9838-3bd0befd2bd6'::uuid, 'Eckner Street', 'eckner-street-kitty-hawk-nc', 'Kitty Hawk', 'NC', 'Outer Banks', 'America/New_York', 36.08823, -75.70172, 'beach', 'intermediate', ARRAY['rip currents','shifting sandbars','rapidly changing currents']::text[], ARRAY['Public shoreline access','Coordinate-reviewed surf-zone pin','Reviewed local swell exposure']::text[], 'Eckner Street is an Atlantic sandbar surf zone at Kitty Hawk in Outer Banks. The representative coordinate marks nearshore water, not a fixed takeoff; sandbars, currents, and access conditions can change.', 'Use signed public access and legal parking; verify posted restrictions before leaving the vehicle.', 'Use the official public access serving this shoreline and obey closures, dune protections, and seasonal surf-zone rules.', 'Light offshore wind and manageable swell; useful tide varies with the active sandbar. No fixed tide-height or period optimum is claimed. The swell window describes estimated exposure, not ideal direction or guaranteed rideable surf.', 'Spread out across shifting peaks and avoid guarded swim areas.', 'The guide describes surf across tide stages, conditional on the local sand configuration. No fixed stage or flood-versus-ebb optimum is established.', ARRAY['Check current rip-current and closure notices','The map pin is not a navigation route']::text[], 'moderate', 350, 110, 50, 60, 60, 240, NULL, '8651370', 'The guide describes surf across tide stages, conditional on the local sand configuration. No fixed stage or flood-versus-ebb optimum is established. Numeric MLLW height bounds are not established.', 'MHX', 'AMZ150', 'MHX/89,125', 36.08823, -75.70172, 36.1152, -75.64387, 6, 60, 'exposed_beach_break'::public.beach_persona, 1, ARRAY[8,9,10,11,12,1,2,3]::integer[], true, true, false, 'Public catalog record with reviewed geometry and conservative editorial guidance; unknown calibration values remain unset rather than disabling publication.', '[{"url":"https://www